          },
          "body_html": "<p>The average effective tariff rate is customs duty revenue as a share of the value of goods imports. The historical series runs through 2024; the dashed lines project the post- and pre-substitution rates implied by 2025–2026 tariff policy. The two horizontal reference lines mark the current post- and pre-substitution rates.</p>",
          "section": "rates",
          "figureNum": 1
